  "0_outline_root": "ROOT: Delivery Handling > Requirements",
  "0_outline_lines": [
    "L046: \"Dataset conforming to DeliveryHandling attribute MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L048: \"*FOCUS dataset* MUST NOT require practitioners to deduplicate records within or across delivered dataset artifacts.\"",
    "  L049: \"When using Overwrite delivery mechanism, *FOCUS dataset* MUST adhere to the following additional requirements:\"",
    "    L050: \"*FOCUS dataset* MUST represent a complete snapshot for a given [*delivery scope*](#glossary:delivery-scope).\"",
    "    L051: \"*FOCUS dataset* MUST supersede all previously delivered *dataset artifacts* for the same *delivery scope*.\"",
    "  L052: \"*FOCUS dataset* MUST preserve all previously delivered *dataset artifacts* when using Append delivery mechanism.\"",
    "  L053: \"*FOCUS dataset* SHOULD have delivered *dataset artifacts* accompanied by corresponding [FOCUS Metadata](#metadata).\"",
    "  L054: \"*FOCUS dataset* delivery mechanism documentation MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "    L055: \"*FOCUS dataset* delivery mechanism documentation MUST include the delivery mechanism used (Overwrite or Append).\"",
    "    L056: \"*FOCUS dataset* delivery mechanism documentation MUST include the conditions under which each delivery mechanism applies when more than one delivery mechanism is used.\"",
    "    L057: \"*FOCUS dataset* delivery mechanism documentation MUST include the mechanism for correlating *dataset artifacts* with the [FOCUS Metadata Schema object](#metadata.schema) when the Metadata is delivered.\"",
    "    L058: \"*FOCUS dataset* delivery mechanism documentation MUST be accessible to practitioners.\""
  ],
